**Bandwidth and rate:** at least 10 kHz wide with sampling at ≥ 10× the highest frequency of interest, so peaks are captured; keep an analogue anti-alias filter in front of the ADC.

**Mounting:** stud-mounted on a flat, clean surface close to the load path, with a mechanical filter or soft cable strain relief if the sensor''s specification requires one. Stiff mounting keeps the mounted resonance high.

**Checks:** record a quiet baseline and look for post-shock offsets; verify range margin before the event.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
